_        Additional Work: ReDone-Subs

01:37.320 --> 01:38.910
My name is Asami.

01:38.910 --> 01:41.240
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:41.240 --> 01:44.500
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:44.500 --> 01:45.790
I'm actually married.

01:46.910 --> 01:51.090
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:52.250 --> 01:54.130
Another day of great weather.

01:59.470 --> 02:03.970
Say, Darling... the weather's going to stay good for awhile, isn't it?

02:05.680 --> 02:09.900
These clear autumn days are practically begging us to go stargazing.

02:09.900 --> 02:11.900
The autumn night sky...

02:11.900 --> 02:15.900
...features many constellations that appear in ancient Ethiopian legends.

02:16.490 --> 02:20.240
Ah, sorry for talking about stars so early in the morning.

02:20.240 --> 02:24.830
You shouldn't be;
I love your astronomy stories.

02:25.290 --> 02:28.830
Say, would you like
to go stargazing sometime soon?

02:29.290 --> 02:30.540
We really can?

02:30.920 --> 02:32.630
Yes, I promise to take you.

02:32.630 --> 02:33.840
That sounds wonderful!

02:34.670 --> 02:36.050
It's a date.

02:36.840 --> 02:41.800
Tearful Stargazing

02:48.890 --> 02:53.820
Sorry to spring this on you all,
but can anyone cover night duty?

02:54.150 --> 02:57.190
It would be Takagi-sensei's turn,
but he's out sick.

02:57.190 --> 03:00.070
I kind of have things to do.

03:01.610 --> 03:03.700
Umm... I'll do it.

03:05.030 --> 03:08.200
Good to hear.
I'll let you handle it, Ichimaru-sensei.

03:09.250 --> 03:10.290
Yes, sir.

03:10.290 --> 03:13.630
You've got a really big grin on your face.

03:13.630 --> 03:16.210
Yeah? D-Do I?

03:16.210 --> 03:19.010
Is night duty something to be so happy about?

03:19.670 --> 03:22.010
Well, not exactly.

03:22.010 --> 03:26.220
It's not normal for anyone to be
so enthusiastic about it.

03:27.470 --> 03:29.230
Night duty?

03:31.270 --> 03:33.520
Hey, Kasumi, are you going to your club?

03:33.520 --> 03:34.860
Of course.

03:34.860 --> 03:36.690
Why don't you skip it?

03:36.690 --> 03:37.530
Eh?

03:37.530 --> 03:40.700
Asami, you come too.
Let's have some fun.

03:41.200 --> 03:43.780
Don't you have a new boyfriend?

03:43.780 --> 03:47.290
Yeah, but he hasn't really had time for me, so...

03:47.290 --> 03:50.830
Sorry, I have all kinds
of chores to do at home.

03:51.330 --> 03:52.330
See you.

03:54.710 --> 03:58.420
I'm a housewife,
so I can't be out fooling around.

03:58.750 --> 04:02.260
There's the laundry, cleaning,
and taking care of Kuri, too.

04:04.180 --> 04:09.520
"Kitchen Iwasaki"

04:05.850 --> 04:10.810
Kouhei, do you know where my old
boxed-lunch cookbook is?

04:11.350 --> 04:15.270
Now that I actually need it,
I can't find it at all.

04:15.270 --> 04:19.280
Sheesh, another guy? You never learn.

04:19.650 --> 04:21.110
That's right!

04:21.110 --> 04:24.530
Today's the day I finally break down Ichimaru-sensei's resistance.

04:25.160 --> 04:28.160
Just you watch;
he won't know what hit him!

04:30.160 --> 04:32.540
This is why I was grinning back there.

04:32.540 --> 04:36.580
If I'm on night duty, I get to use
any school equipment as much as I want to.

04:36.580 --> 04:38.090
And also...

04:39.300 --> 04:41.880
You're so late, Darling...

04:45.970 --> 04:48.390
It's his number! Hello.

04:48.390 --> 04:52.390
Asami... the thing is,
I wound up being on duty tonight.

04:53.180 --> 04:54.940
R-Really?

04:54.940 --> 04:57.900
So, why don't you
come join me at school?

04:57.900 --> 04:59.980
We can observe the stars in secret.

05:00.440 --> 05:01.690
Do you mean it?

05:02.240 --> 05:06.070
I mean it. Let's watch the stars while we spend the night together, alone.

05:06.700 --> 05:08.280
Together, alone...

05:08.280 --> 05:09.990
I'm sure it'll be fun.

05:09.990 --> 05:11.990
That sounds great! I'm on my way.

05:13.700 --> 05:17.750
This is awesome, Kuri!
We'll be stargazing together, alone.

05:17.750 --> 05:20.960
Oh yeah, I should dress up a bit.

05:21.550 --> 05:23.050
And make us some meals.

05:25.720 --> 05:27.640
Food, check...

05:29.180 --> 05:31.430
Tea, coffee, check...

05:32.060 --> 05:34.680
Kuri, take care of the house.

05:41.570 --> 05:43.690
The stars really are lovely tonight.

05:47.070 --> 05:50.160
So, I'll be able to hear plenty of stories...

05:50.160 --> 05:54.080
...about the autumn constellations as we watch the stars together.

05:54.080 --> 05:56.290
And then, the two of us will...

05:56.290 --> 05:58.960
Asami, I love you.

05:58.960 --> 06:00.540
I'm so happy.

06:01.750 --> 06:03.210
Darling...

06:13.140 --> 06:16.430
Should I have worn
a more mature outfit?

06:16.980 --> 06:20.860
But, cute clothes would probably make my husband happier.

06:22.480 --> 06:24.900
I hope Asami gets here soon.

06:25.400 --> 06:29.780
I can tell her so many more legends about the autumn constellations tonight.

06:30.450 --> 06:32.620
I want to see Asami looking delighted.

06:35.330 --> 06:37.160
Ah, Asami... Ack!

06:37.540 --> 06:39.540
Good evening, Ichimaru-sensei.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.790
I-Iwasaki-sensei-?!

06:41.790 --> 06:44.130
I heard you wound up on night duty.

06:44.130 --> 06:44.960
Yes...?

06:45.500 --> 06:47.380
Here's a latenight meal for you.

06:47.380 --> 06:49.340
I figured you could use
a midnight snack.

06:49.340 --> 06:50.760
A-Ahh...

06:50.760 --> 06:53.720
I went home to make this for you.

06:53.720 --> 06:57.100
I'm not very good at cooking, but I hope you'll like it.

06:57.100 --> 06:59.600
T-Thank you very much.

07:00.480 --> 07:04.730
However, is it okay to use the telescope without permission?

07:04.730 --> 07:07.650
W-Well, I was just about to put it away.

07:07.650 --> 07:10.030
Ah, I won't tell a soul.

07:10.030 --> 07:12.660
U-Umm, Iwasaki-sensei.

07:13.370 --> 07:15.410
I'll be okay on my own, really.

07:16.830 --> 07:19.460
Stargazing seems like a lot of fun.

07:19.750 --> 07:21.420
May I join you?

07:21.420 --> 07:22.460
Eh!?

07:22.830 --> 07:25.750
I never knew the school
had things like this.

07:27.130 --> 07:30.050
Y-Your breasts are...

07:35.470 --> 07:38.970
So, is this how you look at the stars?

07:38.970 --> 07:41.350
Ahh, I can see them!

07:41.350 --> 07:44.560
I-I have to find a way
to get rid of Iwasaki-sensei.

07:44.560 --> 07:46.980
A-Asami'll be here any minute.

07:46.980 --> 07:50.490
Err... I'm still not done with the settings.

07:50.490 --> 07:52.660
Eh? I can see them just fine.

07:52.660 --> 07:56.450
A-Anyways, let's go back
inside the school for awhile.

07:56.450 --> 07:57.740
What for?

07:57.740 --> 08:00.330
"What for", you say... Well...

08:02.160 --> 08:04.500
Darling, Darling!

08:07.960 --> 08:10.260
So, Iwasaki-sensei...

08:10.260 --> 08:12.090
What's the big deal?

08:20.680 --> 08:22.440
Onohara-san?

08:22.440 --> 08:24.900
U-Umm, this is...

08:25.900 --> 08:28.150
Huh, I'm pretty sure he said...

08:29.020 --> 08:30.990
..."together, alone."

08:36.030 --> 08:38.660
Asami! Wait, Asa-!

08:41.250 --> 08:42.910
G-Go ahead.

08:44.580 --> 08:46.920
O-O-Onohara~!

08:50.590 --> 08:54.130
He said it'd be
just him and me, so why?

08:54.800 --> 08:56.510
I feel so stupid.

08:57.220 --> 08:59.850
I even packed a meal and dressed up.

08:59.850 --> 09:02.560
And I showed up with my heart racing.

09:04.730 --> 09:08.270
Asami! Asami! Wait up.

09:08.650 --> 09:11.820
You've misunderstood;
that didn't mean anything.

09:11.820 --> 09:15.740
Iwasaki-sensei just brought me
a midnight snack.

09:15.740 --> 09:20.120
That's all she did;
I just couldn't get her to leave.

09:21.290 --> 09:24.660
That's how it was? But I...

09:25.460 --> 09:29.500
I'm sorry. Even though I know
it's nothing worth crying over...

09:29.500 --> 09:31.210
I'm going home.

09:32.090 --> 09:33.590
Asami!

09:36.340 --> 09:40.600
Dammit all to hell!
How could this happen to me!?

09:40.600 --> 09:43.180
Ah, so that's the story.

09:42.140 --> 09:46.980
If I'd known THIS would happen,
I never would've volunteered for night duty!

09:43.180 --> 09:46.980
That demure little thing has herself a nice catch.

09:47.230 --> 09:50.440
I'm up against a kid,
so taking her down should be child's play.

09:52.940 --> 09:55.150
Huh? A text?

09:56.280 --> 09:58.450
Huh, it's from Aneki?

09:58.450 --> 10:00.240
Bad news, Kouhei! (>_<)

10:00.240 --> 10:05.160
It looks like your beloved Onohara-san is dating Ichimaru-sensei! (-_-;)

10:05.540 --> 10:09.500
Huh? What kind of nonsense is Aneki spouting?

10:14.630 --> 10:18.010
Asami... really did return home.

10:27.770 --> 10:29.770
Sorry about
what happened back there.

10:30.810 --> 10:33.150
I really will be fine.

10:33.150 --> 10:35.780
So, please go back to school.

10:36.610 --> 10:37.820
Asami...

10:38.400 --> 10:40.410
Since you're on night duty,

10:40.410 --> 10:43.450
you shouldn't leave the school unguarded for my sake.

10:44.240 --> 10:47.830
I wouldn't want you
to get in trouble over that.

10:48.710 --> 10:49.830
But...

10:50.920 --> 10:52.840
You need to do your job.

10:56.550 --> 10:57.840
I understand.

11:00.090 --> 11:01.510
Asami...

11:01.510 --> 11:05.140
...you're more important to me
than anything else.

11:07.980 --> 11:09.600
I love you more than anyone.

11:12.350 --> 11:16.110
I want our relationship
to stay good forever.

11:19.700 --> 11:22.450
I want you to understand that,
if nothing else.

11:24.410 --> 11:26.910
Well, I'll be heading back.

11:41.470 --> 11:46.060
I was... really looking forward to tonight.

11:46.470 --> 11:49.810
But, Iwasaki-sensei was at school,

11:49.810 --> 11:53.600
and I couldn't say anything,
no matter how upset I was.

11:54.100 --> 11:57.980
Even though I'm his wife,
all I could do was watch silently.

11:57.980 --> 12:01.700
After all, I'm nothing more than a high school girl.

12:03.660 --> 12:06.080
I beg of you, Darling.

12:07.240 --> 12:10.410
Please grant me a heart that will never waver...

12:11.000 --> 12:13.670
...no matter what happens.

12:18.880 --> 12:20.670
My name is Asami.

12:20.670 --> 12:22.930
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

12:23.380 --> 12:27.390
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:27.390 --> 12:28.930
I'm actually married.

12:30.600 --> 12:34.980
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

12:48.160 --> 12:49.790
Ichimaru-sensei!

12:50.660 --> 12:52.450
Iwasaki-sensei!?

12:52.450 --> 12:54.290
How was night duty?

12:54.290 --> 12:58.170
Ahh, yes, there were no incidents after that point.

12:59.170 --> 13:01.840
Can I have a moment of your time?

13:02.130 --> 13:03.720
S-Sure.

13:10.510 --> 13:13.390
I will trust my husband.

13:14.140 --> 13:14.770
However...

13:17.270 --> 13:20.020
...I'm still a little worried.

13:21.530 --> 13:26.410
I Won't Lose to a Little Girl

13:26.490 --> 13:28.160
Science Prep Room

13:27.450 --> 13:30.280
Umm, Iwasaki-sensei?

13:31.740 --> 13:35.540
You don't have to freak out.
I'll keep your secret for you.

13:38.710 --> 13:42.920
Aren't you going out with
that 2nd-year, Onohara-san?

13:44.550 --> 13:48.300
Teachers aren't supposed to lay hand
on their students, right?

13:48.300 --> 13:50.680
W-Well, y-yeah, but...

13:50.680 --> 13:54.220
Of course, it'd be hypocritical for me to condemn that.

13:54.220 --> 13:57.980
Umm... actually, Asami is a student who also enjoys stargazing.

13:57.980 --> 14:02.940
Huh? Do you normally address students like that by their given names?

14:02.940 --> 14:04.740
As in, "Asami."

14:07.110 --> 14:11.490
It's okay. I won't tell anyone that you're dating her.

14:12.330 --> 14:14.750
Ahh, thank you very much.

14:15.290 --> 14:17.960
So you admit that you ARE dating her?

14:17.960 --> 14:19.330
N-No, not...

14:19.330 --> 14:24.210
I <i>told<i> you not to worry;
your secret's safe with me.</i></i>

14:24.210 --> 14:26.300
In exchange...

14:27.380 --> 14:29.180
Can you promise me...

14:29.180 --> 14:32.430
...that you won't
see Onohara-san anymore?

14:34.560 --> 14:38.020
Can you agree to that, Ichimaru-sensei?

14:39.730 --> 14:42.730
I-Iwasaki-sensei...

14:44.570 --> 14:47.570
I-I have to get to class.

14:50.240 --> 14:54.030
Don't forget... your promise.

14:58.040 --> 15:01.080
Iwasaki-sensei's driven me into a corner.

15:01.500 --> 15:03.790
How<i> do I get out of it?</i>

15:21.690 --> 15:24.190
My husband's the only one here.

15:26.020 --> 15:30.070
Umm, I have a little something
I want to ask.

15:32.610 --> 15:35.200
In truth, it's about Iwasaki-sensei.

15:35.620 --> 15:36.870
This is so bad.

15:36.870 --> 15:39.870
If Iwasaki-sensei sees us
in a place like this...

15:42.120 --> 15:43.460
Onohara...

15:43.460 --> 15:46.920
The next period's about to start. Please return to your classroom.

15:48.050 --> 15:49.170
Come now.

15:49.170 --> 15:51.050
H-Hey!

15:52.840 --> 15:57.470
The moment I mentioned Iwasaki-sensei, my husband suddenly...

15:58.850 --> 16:00.020
Whatever!

16:05.400 --> 16:07.770
Asami, forgive me.

16:07.770 --> 16:09.860
I'll explain everything at home.

16:09.860 --> 16:11.530
I'm impressed!

16:12.610 --> 16:15.370
You sure know how to
handle things, Ichimaru-sensei.

16:15.370 --> 16:17.660
I-Iwasaki-sensei.

16:17.660 --> 16:19.700
W-Were you watching?

16:20.080 --> 16:21.710
Accidentally.

16:23.710 --> 16:28.630
You followed my orders
to the letter. How adorable.

16:28.630 --> 16:31.760
I-I have to get back to the staff room.

16:34.340 --> 16:37.930
I guess he's not as cold-hearted
as he seems.

16:45.810 --> 16:49.190
I'm really riled up right now.

16:49.360 --> 16:54.240
Onohara, the next period's about to start. Please return to your classroom.

16:54.400 --> 16:56.660
H-Hey!

16:58.160 --> 17:00.330
If he's going to treat me like that...

17:00.910 --> 17:03.210
...tonight's gonna be
punishment time!

17:07.750 --> 17:12.550
"Super Spicy Corner"

17:26.850 --> 17:30.150
Asami must be angry with me.

17:31.110 --> 17:32.860
I-I'm home.

17:34.780 --> 17:36.150
Welcome back.

17:41.540 --> 17:43.580
Not <i>that</i> angry, apparently.

17:43.580 --> 17:44.750
Eh?

17:44.750 --> 17:46.960
It's nothing.

17:46.960 --> 17:50.130
Let's eat. I'm starved.

17:55.090 --> 17:58.510
Ah, you sure made quite a bit...

17:58.510 --> 18:00.600
Y-Yeah...

18:03.020 --> 18:04.810
Well then...

18:12.520 --> 18:14.530
P-Pretty spicy, isn't it?

18:14.990 --> 18:18.490
I knew it. Asami is<i> mad at me.</i>

18:21.580 --> 18:23.580
Asami, I'm sorry.

18:24.490 --> 18:29.000
A-Actually, Iwasaki-sensei has found out...

18:29.420 --> 18:31.130
...about us.

18:31.130 --> 18:34.960
Eh!? So the jig is up?

18:35.510 --> 18:39.130
Though it seems she thinks that we're only dating.

18:39.930 --> 18:42.470
Is that so?

18:42.890 --> 18:46.480
I wasn't able to conceal it from her.
Forgive me.

18:49.850 --> 18:52.360
Nah... I feel relieved.

18:53.900 --> 18:56.940
I thought there was a chance that you...

18:56.940 --> 18:59.610
...preferred Iwasaki-sensei over me.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.660
I was anxious.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.700
Asami.

19:05.790 --> 19:08.580
You're the only one for me.

19:09.870 --> 19:11.790
Darling.

19:12.830 --> 19:14.130
Asami.

19:15.130 --> 19:20.130
From now on, I'll stop pulling the wool over your eyes, and tell you everything.

19:20.800 --> 19:21.680
Okay.

19:22.680 --> 19:26.060
However, we still need to do something about Iwasaki-sensei.

19:26.600 --> 19:31.100
It'll be fine, as long as we avoid
drawing attention our way at school.

19:31.770 --> 19:36.940
We'll just have to make sure no one sees us together outside of school.

19:36.940 --> 19:37.860
That's right.

19:39.440 --> 19:42.410
Asami... this is all my fault.

19:42.410 --> 19:45.910
I'm also to blame,
for not trusting you enough.

19:50.580 --> 19:51.920
Darling...

20:02.180 --> 20:04.300
Evening~!

20:05.180 --> 20:06.720
S-Sasuke-kun!

20:13.480 --> 20:15.690
Say, Asami-oneechan...

20:16.570 --> 20:19.360
Can I stay here tonight?

20:23.450 --> 20:26.530
But I guess it's wrong,
so maybe I shouldn't.

20:26.530 --> 20:28.700
Sorry about everything.

20:29.580 --> 20:31.160
Sasuke-kun?

20:31.660 --> 20:34.920
Mama will be late again tonight.

20:34.920 --> 20:37.420
I can sleep by myself.

20:37.880 --> 20:39.920
Sasuke-kun...

20:41.970 --> 20:45.390
Still... I really am lonely.

20:46.010 --> 20:48.760
Y-You're welcome to stay, of course.

20:49.350 --> 20:50.720
Really?

20:50.720 --> 20:54.850
Thanks, Asami-oneechan!

20:54.850 --> 20:56.650
It's okay, isn't it?

20:57.190 --> 20:58.820
Y-Yeah.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.420
Asami.

21:17.420 --> 21:21.500
Next time, we'll watch the stars together alone. For real.

21:23.420 --> 21:25.760
Okay, Darling.

21:26.930 --> 21:29.300
Sweet dreams, Asami.

21:38.060 --> 21:40.900
Lots of troubling things happened to me,

21:40.900 --> 21:44.900
but I feel like our bond as a couple has become stronger.

21:45.700 --> 21:48.820
Good night and sleep tight, Darling.

22:15.890 --> 22:19.400
All I am is a kitten

22:15.890 --> 22:19.400
watashi wa koneko

22:19.400 --> 22:23.320
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.400 --> 22:23.320
anata hitori dake no

22:23.320 --> 22:30.200
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.320 --> 22:30.200
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.740 --> 22:34.240
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.740 --> 22:34.240
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.240 --> 22:38.420
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.240 --> 22:38.420
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.420 --> 22:41.840
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.420 --> 22:41.840
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.840 --> 22:47.760
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.840 --> 22:47.760
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.760 --> 22:55.140
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.760 --> 22:55.140
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.140 --> 23:02.060
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.140 --> 23:02.060
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.690 --> 23:12.200
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.690 --> 23:12.200
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:29.010 --> 23:44.980
Preview

23:29.760 --> 23:31.550
Asami here.

23:31.890 --> 23:34.220
I received a marriage proposal,

23:34.220 --> 23:37.060
but I can't say that I'm already married!

23:37.060 --> 23:39.060
What should I do?

23:39.060 --> 23:43.190
So please, love me lots next week too.
